UnitRootBufferUpgradeable::__RootBufferUpgradeable_init
├── When already initialized
│   └── It should revert with InvalidInitialization
├── When size is zero
│   └── It should revert with RootBuffer_InvalidSize
└── When size is greater than zero
    ├── It should set rootHistorySize to size
    └── It should set currentRootIndex to last possible position

UnitRootBufferUpgradeable::isKnownRoot
├── When root is zero
│   └── It should return false
└── When root is not zero
    ├── Given buffer is empty
    │   └── It should return false
    ├── Given root does not exist in buffer
    │   └── It should return false
    ├── Given root is at current index
    │   └── It should return true
    ├── Given root is at an earlier index
    │   └── It should return true
    └── Given root is at oldest index
        └── It should return true

UnitRootBufferUpgradeable::_updateRoot
├── Given buffer has space
│   ├── It should store root at next index
│   └── It should increment currentRootIndex
└── Given currentRootIndex is at last position
    ├── It should overwrite oldest root
    └── It should wrap currentRootIndex to zero
